Replaces: gl-stereo-savers (<< 0.4.6~)
Description: Screensavers page for System Settings
 The classic screensaver selection page: the list of every screensaver the
 edition ships (the stereo catalogue's and XScreenSaver's 2D ones), a small
 live preview of the selected one, a full-screen preview, which savers the
 stereo show rotates through and its times, with links to Wallpaper, Screen
 Locking, Display & Monitor and Power Management. The "Stereo Screensavers"
 launcher opens it.
